Package: cigamingos-tools
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CiGaming <admin@snugglesmp.com>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: cigamingos-branding (= @VERSION@), bash, sudo, pciutils
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: CiGaming OS helper command and first-boot setup
 Provides the `cigaming` command (fetch, update, apps, nvidia, edition)
 and a one-time first-boot service that installs the default Flatpak
 apps listed in /etc/cigamingos/flatpaks.list.
